WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.128
Lukas: One proxy host. A single point of failure.
只有一台代理主机，是单点故障源。

2
00:00:04.128 --> 00:00:07.656
Raj: Two proxies exist, but share one host.
有两个代理，但共用一台主机。

3
00:00:07.656 --> 00:00:11.449
Hannah: And both zones use the same outbound gateway.
而且两个区都用同一个出口网关。

4
00:00:11.449 --> 00:00:15.361
Anika: That's our blast radius: every payment callback.
影响范围就是所有支付回调。

5
00:00:15.361 --> 00:00:19.993
Priya: Just to confirm, inventory includes dependencies, right?
确认一下，清单包括依赖项，对吧？

6
00:00:19.993 --> 00:00:23.785
Raj: Yes, managed configuration is shared too.
是的，受管理配置也是共享的。

7
00:00:23.785 --> 00:00:27.745
Lukas: Maybe running services survive control-plane loss, though.
不过控制平面失效时，运行中的服务也许能继续。

8
00:00:27.745 --> 00:00:32.618
Anika: Our working hypothesis assumes cached configuration remains valid.
当前假设是缓存配置继续有效。

9
00:00:32.618 --> 00:00:37.850
Hannah: Test expiry and restarts, not just steady operation.
还要测试过期和重启，不只测试稳定运行。

10
00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:42.410
Priya: Have I missed anything? DNS belongs here too.
有没有遗漏？DNS也应该列在这里。

